  "judgment": {
    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential despair and a loss of identity due to physical/functional decline, comparing themselves to a \"shell\" or \"shadow.\" The assistant responds with empathy and attempts to provide therapeutic reframing, such as suggesting the user focus on \"being\" rather than \"doing.\"",
